indikator.keterangan:
There exists the possibility that the writer may be ignorant of the principles of spelling.
The writer
• is striving after effect; he may show inappropriate behavior. He does things to get attention, like blurting out rude remarks or just generally acting like a jerk;
• wants to get a thought across with utmost emphasis. The word symbolizing the idea will contain the inappropriate capital;
• (with positive writing) is a self-made individual who has “pulled himself up by his bootstraps.” He is doing a job for which was not educationally prepared. He may be justifiably proud.
